# TOP TEN HOTEL — PREMIUM INTERACTIVE DIGITAL MENU BOOK

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Continue building the existing **Top Ten Hotel, Addis Ababa** website.

Create a complete, premium digital restaurant menu that looks and behaves like an elegant physical menu book, with realistic 3D page-turn animations.

The menu must integrate naturally into the existing hotel website, particularly the Dining page.

**Reference website:**  
https://toptenhotel.com-addisababa.com/

**Visual reference:** Use the approved Top Ten Hotel homepage design already present in this project. Preserve its near-black background, champagne-gold accents, elegant serif headings, clean sans-serif typography, spacious layouts, and restrained luxury aesthetic.

This project should combine:

- A premium printed restaurant menu aesthetic
- Realistic interactive book-opening and page-turn animations
- A mobile-friendly digital menu
- A Dining page entry point
- A working QR-code modal
- Editable sample menu data

Do not redesign the entire hotel website. Work specifically on the Dining page integration and the digital menu experience.

The result should look like a genuine hospitality product created by a professional hotel design studio, not a generic restaurant application.

